{"year":"2024","content":[{"type":"text","content_text":"The 77th Cannes Film Festival took place from May 14 to 25, 2024, with <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 45400, 'screen_type': person}\">Greta Gerwig</a> as jury president. <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 1064213, 'screen_type': movie}\">Anora</a> (2024), by <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 118415, 'screen_type': person}\">Sean Baker</a>, won the Palme d'Or, and the four actresses of <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 974950, 'screen_type': movie}\">Emilia Pérez</a> (2024) shared the Best Actress award. Sentenced to prison in Iran, <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 935123, 'screen_type': person}\">Mohammad Rasoulof</a> fled the country to present <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 1278263, 'screen_type': movie}\">Les Graines du figuier sauvage</a> (The Seed of the Sacred Fig, 2024), which received a special jury prize. Meryl Streep, Studio Ghibli and George Lucas received honorary Palmes d'Or."},{"type":"person_list","title":"The Jury","persons":[{"id":45400,"name":"Greta Gerwig","profile_path":"/dxKAhpkz4XNwmRzMG5QOpXjPZ1N.jpg"},{"id":51894,"name":"J. A. Bayona","profile_path":"/gp2jMYjJqG6AsY3cvwNSQcFgEkN.jpg"},{"id":307141,"name":"Ebru Ceylan","profile_path":"/c4u4ktKaJdJTws7FQ47Zmv1eW7x.jpg"},{"id":17839,"name":"Pierfrancesco Favino","profile_path":"/hedzgTKFKrSleWvLkBlANng8w4T.jpg"},{"id":1183917,"name":"Lily Gladstone","profile_path":"/zYAN84WqZv2sbVE2JDkcWoXGoF7.jpg"},{"id":10912,"name":"Eva Green","profile_path":"/vwjOWfUeDk5fQr8jraKlR1Yfxxq.jpg"},{"id":25645,"name":"Hirokazu Kore-eda","profile_path":"/9Quu2Jo5ItVgs8V1YPCaLEHc8y1.jpg"},{"id":53431,"name":"Nadine Labaki","profile_path":"/mV1JAlM4CAdzosSqZs2ch2TPKLS.jpg"},{"id":78423,"name":"Omar Sy","profile_path":"/Uuy6WuizieB4fOIGFp0gY90Yq2.jpg"}]},{"type":"awards_nominees","name":"Palme d'Or","nominee_list":[{"type":"movie","id":1064213,"name":"Anora","image_path":"/v8Pq2MwPXWDCg1MF3UxNlBCkgDA.jpg","di